    "div" : "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ta-workflow-status-reason</b></p><a name=\"ta-workflow-status-reason\"> </a><a name=\"hcta-workflow-status-reason\"> </a><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-ta-workflow.html\"><code>https://fhir.twiin.nl/ig/workflow/CodeSystem/ta-workflow</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version &#x1F4E6;0.3.0-draft</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ta-workflow.html#ta-workflow-not-selected\">not-selected</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Not selected</td><td>The Placer has selected another candidate; the Coordination Task of this candidate is cancelled.</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
